<h1 align="center">SQLite Source Repository</h1>

This repository contains the complete source code for the
[SQLite database engine]([REDACTED_URL_SHA256:d485dec36427e059] including
many test scripts.  However, other test scripts
and most of the documentation are managed separately.

See the [on-line documentation]([REDACTED_URL_SHA256:41ca4dab34acbe60] for more information
about what SQLite is and how it works from a user's perspective.  This
README file is about the source code that goes into building SQLite,
not about how SQLite is used.

## Version Control

SQLite sources are managed using
[Fossil]([REDACTED_URL_SHA256:b30037e6e54c4311] a distributed version control system
that was specifically designed and written to support SQLite development.
The [Fossil repository]([REDACTED_URL_SHA256:20bb1c6a73769656] contains the urtext.

If you are reading this on GitHub or some other Git repository or service,

